# Code style

- **TypeScript strict**; explicit types; pure functions where possible; no top-level side effects (except CLI entry)
- **Errors:** fail fast with context; custom error classes for domain errors
- **Imports:** relative for local modules; never from `dist/`; barrel exports via `index.ts`
- **Lint:** keep ESLint + Prettier passing

Full detail: [`.agents/docs/RULES-code-style.md`](../../.agents/docs/RULES-code-style.md)
